## ObjectType: Unsettled Receivable

Non-netted unsettled sell receivable at contractual price translated to USD. Buy payables, PFE, EAD and replacement-cost risk are excluded.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| exposure_id | Exposure Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | exposure_id |
| portfolio_id | Portfolio Id | string | Foreign key to portfolios; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | portfolio_id |
| counterparty_id | Counterparty Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | counterparty_id |
| as_of_date | As Of Date | date | Business snapshot date, distinct from quote/fixing date and date of knowledge. | as_of_date |
| unsettled_receivable | Unsettled Receivable | decimal | Sum of open sell quantity × execution quote × factor × as-of FX; USD 2dp, non-netted, no buy payables. | unsettled_receivable |
| currency | Currency | string | Base currency USD; amounts are expressed in dollars. | currency |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: exposure_id
